                <br/>- Made as a senior in HS.
            </li>
            <li><a href="https://thunderstore.io/c/boneworks/p/extraes/ZW_Bank/">ZW_Bank</a>:
                the first BONEWORKS custom map that hooked into the game's zombie navigation code and let
                NPCs climb over obstacles, jump gaps, and take ziplines to reach the player.
                The map geometry is a port of a CS:GO map, but modifications were made for optimization and
                I had to re-light the map in Unity.
                <br/>- Made as a senior in HS.
            </li>

            <li><a href="https://github.com/extraes/BW-Chaos">BW Chaos</a> (and an unpublished BONELAB port):
                A collection of effects that mess with the VR Game "BONEWORKS," with Twitch and Discord
                support, so a live audience can influence the game.
                <br/>- Made as a sophomore and junior in HS.
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pictochat-message">
        <header class="ds-darkpurple-50">extraes</header>
        <span>
            Anyways, thanks for checking out what I've got here! 
        </span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pictochat-status pictochat-exit-highlight">
        <span>extraes left</span>
    </div>
